#ASSERT `s 130AE(4) the Court may make an order directing the company and any officer of the company to make good the default` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 130AE(4) the Court may make an order directing the company and any officer of the company to make good the default` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 130AE(4) the order may provide that all costs of and incidental to the application be borne by the company or by any officer of the company in default in such proportions as the Court thinks fit` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 130AE(4) the order may provide that all costs of and incidental to the application be borne by the company or by any officer of the company in default in such proportions as the Court thinks fit` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
